  "releaseNotes": "Targets .NET 10 (net10.0) instead of .NET 9. Projects on .NET 8 or 9 should stay on 1.0.0.3.\n\t\t\tNo public API changes since 1.0.0.3.\n\t\t\tDependency changes: Xeption 2.8.0 to 2.9.0 and, in AzureBlobStorage, Azure.Identity 1.13.1 to 1.21.0, Azure.Storage.Blobs 12.23.0 to 12.30.1, Azure.Storage.Files.DataLake 12.21.0 to 12.28.0 and Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection 9.0.0 to 10.0.12.\n\t\t\tAzureBlobStorage moves GovukNotify from 7.2.0 to 8.2.0, a major version. GovukNotify 8 drops .NET 9 and earlier and updates its JWT and Newtonsoft.Json dependencies, with no API changes.\n\t\t\tThe package license changes from MIT to Apache 2.0.",
